BT 1 0 0 1 0 68 Tm /F1 10 Tf 13 TL ("Perspectives on Technology and Applications of AI" \227 Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) is poised to disrupt our) Tj T* (world. With intelligent machines enabling high-level cognitive processes like thinking, perceiving, learning,) Tj T* (problem solving and decision making, coupled with advances in data collection and aggregation, analytics) Tj T* (and computer processing power, AI presents opportunities to complement and supplement human) Tj T* (intelligence and enrich the way people live and work. India, being the fastest growing economy with the) Tj T* (second largest population in the world, has a significant stake in the AI revolution.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 62.69291 367.5354 cm
q
.133333 .14902 .168627 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 94 Tm /F1 10 Tf 13 TL (From an applications perspective, the approach is to identify sectors that may have the potential of) Tj T* (greatest externalities while adopting AI solutions, and hence require the government to play a leading role) Tj T* (in developing the implementation roadmap for AI. For example, the agriculture sector in India, which forms) Tj T* (the bedrock of India's economy, needs multi-layered technology infusion and coordination amongst) Tj T* (several stakeholders. Efforts from private sector may neither be financially optimal nor efficient on a) Tj T* (standalone basis, and hence sustained government intervention to tackle the existing challenges and) Tj T* -0.002515 Tw (constraints is needed. Hence, India's approach to implementation of AI has to be guided by optimisation of) Tj T* 0 Tw (social goods, rather than maximisation of topline growth.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 62.69291 302.5354 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 55 Tm 13 TL /F1 10 Tf .133333 .14902 .168627 rg (From a technology perspective, the strategy is to maximise the late-movers' advantage. Acknowledging) Tj T* (that India is some distance away from consistently delivering home grown pioneering technology solutions) Tj T* (in AI, adapting and innovating the technology for India's unique needs and opportunities would help it in) Tj T* (leap frogging, while simultaneously building the foundational R) Tj (&D; capability aimed at ensuring) Tj T* (competitiveness in the long run.) Tj T* ET
